<title>USA: TABLE- AMERICAN ISRAELI Q2 NET DROPS.</title>
<headline>TABLE- AMERICAN ISRAELI Q2 NET DROPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Israeli Paper Mills Ltd</p>
<p>				   Summary of results</p>
<p>				   unaudited</p>
<p>	     Adjusted NIS in thousands except per share amounts</p>
<p>					 Three months ended June 30,</p>
<p>						    Adjusted NIS</p>
<p>					1997			    1996</p>
<p> Net sales			288,081			 271,062</p>
<p> Net earnings		     7,519		     55,228(A)</p>
<p> Earnings per share		1.85			14.51(A)</p>
<p>					  Six months ended June 30,</p>
<p>						    Adjusted NIS</p>
<p>					 1997			   1996</p>
<p> Net sales			603,105			 593,728</p>
<p> Net earnings		    20,916		     69,979(A)</p>
<p> Earnings per share		5.31			18.39(A)</p>
<p>Note:  Adjusted New Israeli Shekel amounts have been adjusted to reflect changes in the rate of exchange between the U.S. dollar and the New Israeli Shekel as at the end of June 1997. The representative exchange rate at June 30, 1997 was NIS 3.587=$1.00</p>
<p>(A) The 1996 results includes an extraordinary capital gain of NIS 45,454,000, or NIS 11.95 per share.</p>
<p>Source:  American Israeli Paper Mills Ltd</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
